    "body": "Mostly nits\r\n\r\nOne thing I noticed that you're probably already aware of: If you take navigation entries from a same-process same-origin iframe/window, then the timing of the \"dispose\" event is linked to the other document, and that timing will be incorrect when observed by the parent window.",
